cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ImageJAI in published work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ImageJAI: a conversational AI assistant for ImageJ/Fiji"
abstract: >-
  Fiji/ImageJ plugin that adds a conversational AI assistant to ImageJ.
  Supports natural-language control, multi-step pipeline generation,
  vision reasoning over open images, multi-specialist agents
  (segmentation, measurement, visualisation, statistics, hypothesis-driven
  analysis), parameter exploration, teaching mode, and a TCP command
  server for external agent integration. Compatible with Google Gemini,
  OpenAI-compatible endpoints, and local Ollama backends.
authors:
